	abstract = {This paper tries to document Husserl's reflections on the problem of \enquote{situations} in his later manuscripts of the 1930s. These reflections are centered on the phenomenon of \enquote{typificiation}, which plays an important part in Husserl's genetic phenomenology. Thus, the paper starts by sketching out a general presentation of \enquote{typification} in its relation to expectation and habit. By defining situation as \enquote{the intentional living unity of horizontal context and subjective potentiality}, the paper then tries to follow husserl's exposition
